KNOWNBUG
empty_argument2.sv
--module main --bound 0
^file .* line 9: no argument for formal `a'$
^EXIT=2$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
--
Empty positions in the argument list of a subroutine call
(1800-2017 13.5.3, A.6.9 list_of_arguments) are not supported: a
leading empty position is silently dropped by the parser, and any other
empty position is a syntax error.
